  = hint: work in smaller pieces, or raise the ceiling with CIG_MAX_ALLOC=<bytes>
  = explain: cig explain E514
  = doctor: no known cause matched; cig explain E514 for the general case
  = maybe: a repeat count, width or size computed from bad arithmetic (check the types of the operands, as the message reports them)
  =        a legitimately large value: a big file read whole, or a large string built in one go (I checked an environment variable that changes the limit involved and found CIG_MAX_ALLOC is not set, so the limit is 268435456 bytes)
